# fn@[a Null] union return type annotation with type variable.
# The annotation [a Null] is two positional entries: type variable `a` and Null.
# This must route to the union return type path (not the metadata dict path).
# Regression test: previously failed with "property dict annotation must be a dict expression"
# because the parser rejected lowercase-headed implied calls in annotation position.
[f: [fn@[a Null] [] []]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function()})
